here’s a solid `.gitignore` tailored to your pipeline repo (Python + Geo stack + your `artifacts/` outputs):

```
# ---- OS / Editor junk -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
*.bak
*.tmp
.~*
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- Python bytecode / build ------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.build/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ---- Virtual envs / package managers ---------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
env*/         # e.g. env38, env39
.conda/
pip-wheel-metadata/
poetry.lock
poetry.toml

# ---- Testing / lint / coverage ---------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ---- Jupyter ----------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Keep notebooks by default; comment-in to ignore:
# *.ipynb

# ---- Environment / secrets --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.secret
*.secrets
*.key
*.pem

# Project-specific config overrides (keep example configs tracked)
pipeline/config/*.local.yaml
pipeline/config/*_private.yaml
pipeline/config/*_secrets.yaml

# ---- Pipeline artifacts (generated) -----------------------------------------
artifacts/
# If you ever want to keep the folder but not its contents:
# artifacts/*
# !artifacts/.gitkeep

# In case some runs were placed elsewhere:
**/runs/
**/reports/
**/models/
**/features/
**/ingest/
**/geo/

# Common generated geodata files (in case they leak outside artifacts/)
*.parquet
*.feather
*.gpkg
*.geojson
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.img
*.vrt
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.mbtiles

# Logs
*.log

# ---- Cache folders from geospatial libs ------------------------------------
# elevation (SRTM) cache (often lives under user dir, but ignore if vendored)
.elevation/
cache/
tmp/
temp/

# ---- Prefect / orchestration (if used) --------------------------------------
.prefect/

# ---- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.lock
```

.pkl
*.pkl